  "post_content": "<p>El equipo redactor del Plan Especial del Centro Hist&oacute;rico de Onda, formado por la empresa ondense Cel Ras y Aranea, de Alicante, ultimaba este domingo los trabajos en el Espai Cultural del Raval.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/DSC_0033.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 319px\" /></p>\n<p>Con el apoyo de los arquitectos ondeses de El Fabricante de Espheras, se han elaborado los &uacute;ltimos planos a partir de las fotograf&iacute;as de los puntos en los que vecinos y vecinas han centrado sus propuestas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeplaespecialcentrehistoriconda/dsc_0027.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0027\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeplaespecialcentrehistoriconda/dsc_0028.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0028\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeplaespecialcentrehistoriconda/dsc_0029.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0029\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeplaespecialcentrehistoriconda/dsc_0030.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0030\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeplaespecialcentrehistoriconda/dsc_0031.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0031\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeplaespecialcentrehistoriconda/dsc_0032.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0032\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeplaespecialcentrehistoriconda/dsc_0033.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0033\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeplaespecialcentrehistoriconda/dsc_0034.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0034\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeplaespecialcentrehistoriconda/dsc_0035.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0035\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeplaespecialcentrehistoriconda/dsc_0036.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0036\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeplaespecialcentrehistoriconda/dsc_0037.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0037\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeplaespecialcentrehistoriconda/dsc_0038.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0038\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
